<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "A server can teach itself pictures and answer to them by name. Write :shrug: and everybody on this server sees the picture; everybody elsewhere never does, because the set belongs to the server."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_fmt_emoji}>{dgettext("help_features", "Writing One")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Type the name between two colons, or pick it from the top of the emoji picker, where this server's own are listed above the ones everybody has. A name this server does not have stays exactly as you typed it — it never becomes a broken picture."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_shield}>{dgettext("help_features", "Adding One")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Administrators only, from Admin ▸ Server Emoji. Choose a picture, give it a name, and it is available to everybody here at once. A server holds up to 100, and removing one frees its name again."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_warning}>{dgettext("help_features", "Names")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Two to thirty-two characters: lower-case letters, digits and underscores. That is what somebody can type between two colons without thinking about it, and a name that cannot be typed is an emoji that only half exists."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-emoji">{dgettext("help_features", "Emoji Picker")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="feature-reactions">{dgettext("help_features", "Reactions")}</.help_link>
</p>
